 "said": {
  "text": "rename the Design packs console plugin to UI Review (folder ui-review) and make it one all-in-one UI approval plugin. Every UI a build makes is submitted there for his approval, separated by kind (open registry: Design packs, Whole apps / programs, Screens & pages, Settings interfaces, Dialogs & popups, Menus & toolbars, Banners & cards, Other). Items: title, kind, app, build/branch/PR, desktop + phone shots, notes, status (waiting / approved / changes asked / rejected), his comment, history. Views: tree, collapsible grid, grid with sub-grids, gallery, compare; multi-select + bulk decisions in every view. Builds submit through review.mjs, the plugin API and rebuild-shots --submit; capability ui-review@1. Design-pack picks (MAX 3) migrate. Profile: Angel. Web only.",
  "verbatim": false,
  "at": "2026-10-30T00:00:00Z",
